ENVIRONMENT NOTE
Lean 4.22.0 calls readlink("/proc/<pid>/exe"), while the audit PID namespace exposes only /proc/self/exe. The narrowly scoped shim at /tmp/audit-work/proc-self-readlink-shim.c redirects only numeric /proc/<pid>/exe readlink calls. Its source SHA-256 is 1832335eeaff7a904e67a858de1677ca508c53e8cf3b0d930bfa60216dbafd4b. With LD_PRELOAD set to the compiled shim, `lean --version` returned:
Lean (version 4.22.0, x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, commit ba2cbbf09d4978f416e0ebd1fceeebc2c4138c05, Release)

